from _w import w
w(348,"Tested live in the browser pane by hand. The owner opened Market complaints, gave Rahim Traders a warning with a reason, then switched their selling off with a second reason. Then Rahim Traders signed in and the owner lifted the step.",
 ["Step 1, Warning: it is added to the seller's list with the date and the reason (\"Please answer buyers within two days.\")",
  "Step 2, Switch selling off: the seller shows \"Selling is switched off\" with a Lift it button, and both steps stay listed in order",
  "The seller was told why: their statements page shows \"Your selling is switched off: Three buyers waited more than a week for an answer.\" and the selling page sent them away while it was off",
  "While it was off, none of Rahim Traders' 80 listings showed on the market; only another seller's case stayed",
  "After the owner pressed Lift it the red badge went, and the seller reached their Sell page again"],
 [{"file":"f348_1.jpg","caption":"Owner: selling switched off, with both steps and reasons listed","role":"admin","url":"/admin/market/cases"},
  {"file":"f348_2.jpg","caption":"Seller is told why selling is off","role":"wholesaler","url":"/wholesale/sell/statements"},
  {"file":"f348_3.jpg","caption":"After the lift the seller is back on the Sell page","role":"wholesaler","url":"/wholesale/sell"}],
 ["Done by hand in the live browser. The steps Take a listing down and Hold payouts were not pressed. Online payouts do not exist yet, so Hold payouts is only recorded and shown."])
